Generate the autocompletion script for cron-person for the specified shell.
See each sub-command's help for details on how to use the generated script.

Usage:
  cron-person completion [flags] [command]

Available Commands:
├─ bash               Generate the autocompletion script for bash
├─ fish               Generate the autocompletion script for fish
├─ powershell         Generate the autocompletion script for powershell
╰─ zsh                Generate the autocompletion script for zsh

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for completion

Global Flags:
      --config string   Path to custom configuration file (default:
                        $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
      --store string    Path to custom authorization state file (default:
                        $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)

Use "cron-person completion [command] --help" for more information about a
command.
